Package: rcolapi
Title: Client for the 'Catalogue of Life' and 'ChecklistBank'
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paul Efren", "Santos Andrade", email = "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375")),
    person("Markus", "Döring", email = "mdoering@gbif.org", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7757-1889")),
    person("Catalogue of Life", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Access the Catalogue of Life (COL) through the 'ChecklistBank'
    application programming interface (API) <https://api.checklistbank.org>.
    Match scientific names against public datasets or COL releases and retrieve
    accepted names, synonyms, classifications and geographic distributions.
    Discover datasets and releases, navigate taxonomic trees and parse names
    and controlled values. Return tabular results with input provenance and
    per-row diagnostics for batch matching failures.
